  "检查中…": "Checking…",
  "无": "None",
  "请求最小间隔（毫秒）": "Minimum Request Interval (ms)",
  "所有数据请求按此间隔串行发出。这只是客户端技术节流，不代表符合任何数据平台的配额或条款；请按所用服务的条款自行设置。下限 200ms，默认 1000ms。": "All data requests are sent serially at this interval. This is client-side technical throttling only and does not guarantee compliance with any data platform's quota or terms; set it according to the terms of the services you use. Floor 200ms, default 1000ms.",

  // 免责声明 tab (full legal text).
  "免责声明": "Disclaimer",
  "插件性质": "Nature of the Plugin",
  "本插件仅为数据接入框架与展示工具，本身不提供、不存储、不分发任何金融数据，与任何数据平台均不存在合作、授权或背书关系。": "This plugin is only a data-access framework and display tool. It does not provide, store, or distribute any financial data itself, and has no partnership, authorization, or endorsement relationship with any data platform.",
  "自定义数据源": "Custom Data Sources",
  "本插件不内置任何数据源：所有接口地址（URL）、参数与凭据均由您自行配置并自行调用，或由您运行的脚本产出本地 CSV 文件。您应确保其配置与使用行为符合数据来源平台的服务条款及适用法律，不得利用本插件从事未经授权的数据抓取或访问。": "This plugin ships no data sources: all endpoint URLs, parameters, and credentials are configured and called by you, or produced as local CSV files by scripts you run. You must ensure that your configuration and use comply with the terms of service of the data-source platforms and applicable law, and must not use this plugin for unauthorized data scraping or access.",
  "凭据存储与传输": "Credential Storage and Transmission",
  "您填写的 API Key 保存在 Obsidian 的 SecretStorage 中；插件的 data.json 只保存凭据引用（credentialId），不包含密钥本身。调用 CLI 或 MCP 时，密钥只通过您显式设置的环境变量（STRATABOARD_API_KEY_<数据源ID>）提供，进程不读取 SecretStorage。插件仅在您主动请求数据时，按 {apiKey} 占位符把密钥发送到您配置的接口。请使用最小权限密钥，限制来源与额度，并在怀疑泄露时及时轮换。": "Your API keys are stored in Obsidian's SecretStorage; the plugin's data.json holds only a credential reference (credentialId), never the secret itself. CLI/MCP processes receive keys only through environment variables you explicitly set (STRATABOARD_API_KEY_<source id>) and never read SecretStorage. The plugin sends a key only when you request data, substituting it at {apiKey} for the endpoint you configured. Use a least-privilege key, restrict its origin and quota, and rotate it if exposure is suspected.",
  "Python 脚本以当前系统用户的完整权限运行，可访问网络、读写文件并启动其他进程。插件会在首次运行、路径改变或内容改变后重新请求确认，但不审查、不担保脚本安全。脚本的数据获取行为及授权关系由您自行负责；脚本功能不适合高频数据，不得作为批量下载工具使用。": "Python scripts run with the current OS user's full permissions and can access the network, read and write files, and start other processes. The plugin asks again on first run, path change, or content change, but does not review or guarantee script safety. You are responsible for data-access behavior and authorization; scripts are not intended for high-frequency or bulk downloading.",
  "自定义指标由您提供，在不含网络、文件、DOM、Obsidian API 与 require 的受限环境中运行，并设有执行时间与输出数量上限。该隔离不能替代代码审查。插件不生成、提供、审核、验证或背书指标及其中的买卖标记；仅使用您有权使用且来源可信的代码。": "Custom indicators are user-provided and run in a restricted environment without network, file, DOM, Obsidian API, or require access, with execution-time and output-size limits. This isolation does not replace code review. The plugin does not generate, provide, review, validate, or endorse indicators or their buy/sell markers; use only authorized code from trusted sources.",
  "软件许可证": "Software License",
  "本插件代码依据 MIT 许可证发布，您可以在该许可证允许的范围内使用本插件，包括商业使用。MIT 许可证仅适用于插件代码，不会授予任何第三方数据、内容、商标或服务的额外权利。": "This plugin's code is released under the MIT License and may be used within that license's terms, including commercially. The MIT License applies only to the plugin code and grants no additional rights to third-party data, content, trademarks, or services.",
  "第三方数据授权": "Third-Party Data Authorization",
  "第三方数据的访问、存储、处理、展示、导出、商业使用及再分发范围，以相应数据来源的许可证、服务条款及您实际取得的授权为准。您应自行确认并遵守所需授权、使用配额及适用法律。": "Your rights to access, store, process, display, export, use commercially, or redistribute third-party data are governed by the applicable source license, terms of service, and the authorization you have obtained. You are responsible for confirming and complying with the required authorization, usage quotas, and applicable law.",
  "不构成投资建议": "Not Investment Advice",
  "通过本插件展示的数据、脚本结果、自定义指标及其标记可能存在延迟、错误、遗漏或中断，均不构成投资建议、要约或招揽。据此操作，风险自担。": "Data, script results, custom indicators, and their markers shown through this plugin may be delayed, inaccurate, incomplete, or interrupted and do not constitute investment advice, an offer, or a solicitation. Act on them at your own risk.",
  "无担保与责任限制": "No Warranty & Limitation of Liability",
  "本插件按\"现状\"提供，作者不作任何明示或默示的担保。在适用法律允许的最大范围内，作者不对因使用或无法使用本插件而产生的任何直接或间接损失承担责任。": "This plugin is provided \"as is\", with no express or implied warranty of any kind. To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, the author is not liable for any direct or indirect loss arising from the use of, or inability to use, this plugin.",
