  "响应中未找到可用的数据列表，请检查 URL 与示例代码。": "No usable data list found in the response; check the URL and the sample code.",
  "尚未获取到接口响应，请先粘贴 URL 完成自动检测。": "No endpoint response yet — paste a URL above and let the auto-test run first.",
  "无法自动识别数据格式（或识别结果不对）。请选出包含 K 线行的数据列表，并核对每一列的对应关系。": "The data format could not be auto-detected (or was detected wrong). Pick the list that holds the K-line rows and check each column mapping.",
  "数据列表": "Data List",
  "从响应中识别到的列表，选一个包含 K 线数据的。": "Lists detected in the response; pick the one containing K-line data.",
