  "代码表（可选）": "Code Table (optional)",
  "每行一条「代码 名称」（空格或逗号分隔，名称可含空格）。配置后，插入数据时按名称搜索选择，无需记代码。": "One \"code name\" per line (space- or comma-separated; names may contain spaces). Once configured, 插入数据 offers searchable named picks — no need to memorize codes.",
  "如：CODE_10Y 十年期国债收益率": "e.g. CODE_10Y 10-Year Treasury Yield",
  "当前设置页不编辑符号级 params/profile；此处编辑会按代码保留已有值。接口依赖这类复杂参数时，请改用本地脚本。": "The settings UI does not edit symbol-level params/profile values; editing here preserves existing values by code. Use a local script when an endpoint depends on such complex parameters.",
  "从代码表选择": "Pick from code table",
  "（手工输入）": "(enter manually)",
  "映射包含代码占位符 {code}：取数时按实际代码选列，下方预览使用示例代码。": "The mapping contains the {code} placeholder: the fetch-time code picks the column; the preview below uses the sample code.",
  "当前映射未解析出任何 K 线数据。": "The current mapping produced no K-line rows.",
  "共 {n} 条，预览最新 5 条：": "{n} rows total; previewing the latest 5:",
  "检测到搜索接口的响应格式与 K 线接口不同，搜索可能不可用；两者需为同一格式。": "The search endpoint's response format differs from the K-line endpoint; search may not work — both must share one format.",
  "搜索接口为通用 JSON，如需使用搜索请在字段映射中配置搜索映射。": "The search endpoint is generic JSON; configure the search mapping under field mapping to use it.",
